        "eyebrow": "Downtown Punta Gorda",
        "heading": "Be-YOU-tiful, by Michele",
        "accent": "Accept yourself as you were designed by God",
        "text": "<p>Swimwear to formal wear, everyday favorites to something for a special occasion. Discover Be-YOU-tiful Boutique by Michele in downtown Punta Gorda, with women's styles in sizes XXS to 2X, pieces for kids, babies and toddlers, and affordable prices.</p>",
